From 9717234b9db59393e94508a9eae4690486ae83d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Asbj=C3=B8rn=20Sloth=20T=C3=B8nnesen?= <ast@fiberby.net>
Date: Fri, 26 Apr 2024 09:12:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 038/934] net: qede: sanitize 'rc' in qede_add_tc_flower_fltr()
MIME-Version: 1.0
