From b6ffecfec1fce1c5cc0bcbbc9e4170057dce48c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tetsuo Handa <penguin-kernel@I-love.SAKURA.ne.jp>
Date: Sun, 5 May 2024 23:08:31 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 490/934] dma-buf/sw-sync: don't enable IRQ from
