From b4f68ea9494d30849b18ec500775a881096bc6ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kuniyuki Iwashima <kuniyu@amazon.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Jun 2024 09:52:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 609/934] af_unix: Annotate data-races around sk->sk_state in
