From 30980c1ddf7810167306aa21ab2e61cbfd7b205f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Huang-Huang Bao <i@eh5.me>
Date: Thu, 6 Jun 2024 20:57:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 840/934] pinctrl: rockchip: fix pinmux bits for RK3328 GPIO3-B
 pins

