From b2dab4f3f44c12830a7c7d4af672c5e091c01b42 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Elinor Montmasson <elinor.montmasson@savoirfairelinux.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Jun 2024 15:25:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 847/934] ASoC: fsl-asoc-card: set priv->pdev before using it

[ Upstream commit 90f3feb24172185f1832636264943e8b5e289245 ]

priv->pdev pointer was set after being used in
fsl_asoc_card_audmux_init().
Move this assignment at the start of the probe function, so
sub-functions can correctly use pdev through priv.

fsl_asoc_card_audmux_init() dereferences priv->pdev to get access to the
dev struct, used with dev_err macros.
